  {
    "hotel_id": "1661243",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/nagoya-jr-gate-tower-hotel_2/hotel/all/nagoya-jp.html",
    "name": "Nagoya JR Gate Tower Hotel",
    "detail": "I happened to find this hotel when I was trying to book Marriott. Since we were just going to make a brief stop in Nagoya before going to Mie, we finally booked this one because it is cheaper than Marriott. It turned out to be a good choice. Everything in the hotel is brand new. The room is slightly bigger than those regular business hotel rooms, with not only a bed, and a table, but also a small soft bench by the window from where you can see the fantastic view over Nagoya. The bathroom is spacious too (I really hate unit bath :P). The hotel is directly connected to the Nagoya JR station, on the 15/F of the JR Gate Tower. There is a couple of convenient stores and a Starbucks outside the hotel entrance. The building has express lifts taking you from the hotel to the restaurant levels directly. If you don't feel well, there is also a pharmacy and a clinic (maybe more than one) in the building too. As a business hotel, there are not many facilities to expect. But I did spot a small fitness room in the next to the reception. Overall, this is a perfect stay with good value for money.",
